---
import { asset } from '../lib/assets';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const products = [
  {name:'Organic Cleansing Soap Set',price:'$320,00',image:'J8le3letiGCtf9BkCGIj5iwFo8.webp'},
  {name:'Bamboo Toothbrush Set',price:'$260,00',image:'8dSG1DdepPMilodp7zM1jmERqg.png'},
  {name:'Lavender Herb Soap',price:'$120,00',image:'yL7pHPGgK6B1R4OElhQMQ2lTGqs.webp'},
  {name:'Musk Scrub Soap',price:'$260,00',image:'cJGrzcPtxAC4uwhyOMsORllJw.webp'},
];
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="site-title">
    <img class="hero-image" src={asset("images/HOsnSwEKyQMdolJY5h6Z4ppnQXw.webp")} alt="Warm sunlight across skin" width="1280" height="832" fetchpriority="high" />
    <h1 class="hero-heading" id="site-title"><img class="wordmark" src={asset("images/wordmark-0.svg")} alt="Simple Things. The necessities for everyday simple life." width="1135" height="224" /></h1>
    <div class="hero-tagline" aria-hidden="true"><div class="tagline-top"><span>THE</span><span>NECESSITIES</span></div><div class="tagline-bottom"><span>FOR</span><span>EVERYDAY</span><span class="tagline-dash"></span><span>SIMPLE</span><span>LIFE</span></div></div>
    <a class="scroll-link" href="#next">SCROLL DOWN</a>
  </section>
  <section class="introduction" id="next">
    <p class="eyebrow">Simple Things is a philosophy</p>
    <h2 class="intro-heading">Centered around enhancing the <em>quality</em> of everyday essentials. The items we use daily deserve the <em>highest standards</em> of craftsmanship.</h2>
  </section>
  <section class="nature-section" aria-label="Our materials">
    <div class="nature-copy"><div><p>We believe in the seamless integration of nature's wisdom and scientific innovation,-</p><p>-thereby shaping the essence of our products and brand.</p></div><p>Each piece of a our brand is crafted from the elements of fire, air, water, and nature’s organic materials.</p></div>
    <div class="nature-images"><img class="hands-image" src={asset("images/y3RwMAVGyyTu4eS7Qfq8hf4mUA.webp")} alt="Hands raised into the sunlight" width="1176" height="1809" loading="lazy" /><img class="necklace-image" src={asset("images/6kmb8PHLsuSNJGlDDSDrVCyrGg.webp")} alt="Delicate golden necklace resting against skin" width="1050" height="1389" loading="lazy" /></div>
  </section>
  <section class="ceremony" id="about">
    <img class="ceremony-image" src={asset("images/yUZyseGG11YrsYewOLYLcmSg72A.png")} alt="Water flowing over natural stone" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="ceremony-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Creating a ceremony of everyday self-care</p><h2 class="ceremony-heading">Simple Things is an <em>exceptional</em> brand of curated daily essential products, founded by Alaia McArthy. Our <em>contemporary, organic</em> products are designed to elevate the daily routine.</h2></div>
  </section>
  <section class="story-section" aria-label="Our story and philosophy">
    <article class="story-panel"><img class="story-image" src={asset("images/kaF5mgFDHUAp2eka6aYWOTkAPTQ.png")} alt="A tranquil botanical shower sanctuary" loading="lazy" /><div class="story-copy"><h3 class="story-heading">Simple <em>Story</em></h3><div class="story-paragraphs"><p>Founded by visionary Alaia Mcarthy, Simple Things emerged from a deep appreciation for life's simple pleasures and a desire to infuse them with elegance.</p><p>The vision is to redefine the art of self-care, one exquisite product at a time. A world where every bathroom becomes a sanctuary—a haven of tranquility and beauty, where the simple act of bathing becomes a cherished ritual.</p></div></div></article>
    <article class="story-panel"><img class="story-image" src={asset("images/5vX74tcs2228yztMn1TMxvTKU5M.png")} alt="Sunlight and shadow on a woman's shoulder" loading="lazy" /><div class="story-copy"><h3 class="story-heading">Philosophy</h3><div class="story-paragraphs"><p>With every product we create, we strive to awaken the senses, nourish the soul, and elevate the everyday to the extraordinary.</p><p>We believe that true luxury lies not in extravagance, but in the exquisite attention to detail, the unparalleled quality, and the profound sense of connection that our products evoke.</p></div></div></article>
  </section>
  <section class="products-section" id="products">
    <div class="product-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Our Products</p><h2 class="collection-title">A <em>conscious & unique</em><br />range of quality</h2></div>
    <div class="product-grid">{products.map((product) => <article class="product-card"><div class="product-image-wrapper"><img class="product-image" src={asset('images/'+product.image)} alt={product.name} loading="lazy" /><div class="product-unavailable">Unavailable</div></div><div class="product-details"><h3>{product.name}</h3><p>{product.price}</p></div></article>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="tenet-section"><img class="tenet-image" src={asset("images/o2AhZRDDM8ZwrhsAVEbJWqbO0.png")} alt="Pale mineral rock and water" loading="lazy" /><div class="tenet-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Our tenets</p><h2 class="tenet-heading">Beyond <em>botanical ideals</em></h2><p>Care and wellness goes beyond mere clean and botanical ideals. We embrace ingredients crafted from the elements of fire, air, water, and nature’s organics, making all our products sustainable and ethical.</p></div></section>
  <section class="tenet-section-reverse"><div class="tenet-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Our tenets</p><h2 class="tenet-heading">Crafted with <em>care & purity</em></h2><p>We believe that each product in our daily routine should be crafted with purity and care. Our formulas are meticulously designed to offer soothing and rich experience for today and for a better tomorrow.</p></div><img class="tenet-image" src={asset("images/IGDD6A3SanMnFhYkdLxNC2HvjcA.jpg")} alt="Clear water rippling over golden stone" loading="lazy" /></section>
  <section class="quote-section"><blockquote class="brand-quote">‘A philosophy centered around enhancing the quality of everyday essentials.’</blockquote><p class="eyebrow">— Alaia McArthy</p></section>
  <section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="contact-art"><img class="contact-image" src={asset("images/H2SlTba0yo2JG5NtYxq58Fy70.webp")} alt="Simple Things daily essentials in a sunlit bathroom" loading="lazy" /><div class="contact-posters"><img src={asset("images/qfNrNAShjUXeCroTD7noPSoOrko.png")} alt="Simple Things black brand poster" loading="lazy" /><img src={asset("images/HiQ6xmtk7vlljoFUEsoZjytMmPY.png")} alt="Simple Things white brand poster" loading="lazy" /></div></div><div class="contact-copy"><div><h2 class="contact-heading">Contact</h2><p>For any questions regarding an item sold on the online store or an order placed, you can contact our Customer Relations Service by email at <a class="text-link" href="mailto:contact@simplethings.com">contact@simplethings.com</a>.</p></div><div><h3 class="eyebrow">For Professionals</h3><p>Are you an architect, restaurateur, or professional in the hotel industry? We have an offer tailored to your needs <a class="text-link" href="mailto:professional@simplethings.com">professional@simplethings.com</a></p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
